Z||000015||Lisa 86 2m4||12-24-2000||10:04 AM||||Awesome! So now that I know putting on driving/fog lights can be done, how difficult is it to wire them up?  Any special tools or techniques? I should ask, can an amature do this? <BR>||||reg||5
Z||000016||theogre||12-24-2000||11:39 AM||||The wiring directions and all the stuff you need is included in the better light sets. No special tools are needed but you may have to drill a hole for the switch. If you don't like the included switch you can get alternate ones at radio shack or any other electronics shop and many car audio stores. Just make sure the new switch has the same ratings as the one that comes with the lights.||||reg||1
