Z||000020||Lisa 86 2m4||01-04-2001||05:56 PM||||Since I'm ready to put in my driving lights, I have a few quick questions for those who have dared do this. I have an 86 coupe, and am going to install the lights( nice set I got at Target with both driving and fog for only $50! by Rally)under the nose. Now, I'm guessing the wires will snake up along the radiator on the drivers side, but how will I get it through that first wall, it doesn;t look like I can squeeze it through where the headlight wires go through. Once through, how do I get it through the second wall,best I can figure is all the wires meet in like a giant harness near the brake fluid resevoir, that I put a hole somewhere in the harness? And finally, to give it power the instructions say to hook it up to the 12v wire at the fuse box, is this easier said than done?<BR>Thanks all! I hope my lights turn out as nice as the one's pictured!!<BR>Lisa||||reg||5
